mapping "W071.1" source="W071" target="83468000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W071 SNOMED CT 83468000 = Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of W07 (Fall from chair) adding
        place-of-occurrence (institutional/residential home) and optionally activity. Target SNOMED CT
        4308870 (83468000), the Athena crosswalk target for base ICD10 W07 (concept 45547041). The
        SNOMED CT concept fully subsumes the injury mechanism; the place/activity context has no single
        SNOMED CT equivalent (place-of-occurrence concepts exist as separate SNOMED CT extension concepts but
        the Swedish code bundles mechanism+place+activity). broader, moderate tier: verified base
        crosswalk plus unspecified Swedish contextual detail not independently re-verified.
        """
}
