mapping "W0740.1" source="W0740" target="83468000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W0740 SNOMED CT 83468000 = fall from chair on street/road during sport/exercise. Swedish
        6-char extension of W07 (Fall involving chair). Target SNOMED CT 4308870 = (83468000), standard
        concept (S, Observation/Event). The base ICD-10 W07 has a verified crosswalk to 4308870 in the
        Athena mirror. The Swedish code adds location (street/road) and activity (sport) specificity;
        SNOMED CT has location+chair concepts (e.g. 40419717) but all are retired (invalid_reason=U,
        valid_end=2009-01-31), so 4308870 is the only valid standard target. Broader: target fully
        subsumes the source (every such fall IS a fall from chair); location/activity detail lost. High
        tier : verified crosswalk from parent W07, one-level breadth mismatch.
        """
}
